<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>netstandard2.0</TargetFramework>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>true</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>true</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <Authors>yswenli</Authors>
    <Version>26.11.23.1</Version>
    <Description>MQTT Server and Client Based on SAEA.Socket.SAEA.MQTT基于SAEA.Socket实现的MQTT服务器与客户端
https://github.com/yswenli/SAEA</Description>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>26.11.6.1
- 完整实现 MQTT 5.0 运行时语义：能力协商与 CONNACK 通告、Session Expiry、Will Delay、
  Message Expiry（含 retained）、双向 Topic Alias、共享订阅与订阅选项/订阅标识符、
  Receive Maximum、Maximum Packet Size 与原因码断开。
- 服务端同一端口自动识别 MQTT 3.1 / 3.1.1 / 5.0；客户端默认 MQTT 3.1.1，
  使用 WithProtocolVersion(MqttProtocolVersion.V500) 显式启用 5.0。
- 破坏性变更：IMqttServerOptions 新增 Capabilities 属性；IMqttServerPersistedSession
  新增会话过期相关字段；MqttClientDisconnectOptions 新增 SessionExpiryInterval 与 UserProperties。
- 服务端支持为空 ClientId 自动分配标识符（V5 Assigned Client Identifier）。
- MQTT 3.1 / 3.1.1 报文编码与运行行为保持不变（V3 golden bytes 回归通过）。
https://github.com/yswenli/SAEA</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageIconUrl></PackageIconUrl>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://github.com/yswenli/SAEA</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/yswenli/SAEA</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageTags>mqtt,tcp,socket</PackageTags>
    <PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE.txt</PackageLicenseFile>
    <Copyright>yswenli</Copyright>
    <SignAssembly>False</SignAssembly>
    <AssemblyOriginatorKeyFile>E:\Work\SAEA\Src\SAEA.Sockets.pfx</AssemblyOriginatorKeyFile>
    <LangVersion>8.0</LangVersion>
    <AllowUnsafeBlocks>true</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
    <PackageIcon>favicon.png</PackageIcon>
    <Title>$(AssemblyName)</Title>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\..\favicon.png">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath></PackagePath>
    </None>
    <None Include="..\..\LICENSE.txt">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath></PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\SAEA.Common\SAEA.Common.csproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\SAEA.Sockets\SAEA.Sockets.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Update="README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="SAEA.MQTT.Tests" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
